This has got to be the one of the most stupid deaths of all time.  I started 
the game with a Valkyre, and in the first room, I saw my faithful dog, and two
jackels surrounding me.  No problem, I thought, as I attacked one jackel, 
while my dog attacked the other.  They both were killed, and I stepped
one space south into a trap that blinded me.  Not knowing what was happening,
I wandered around for a few turns while a newt came up and started
attacking me.  It eventually killed me.  I had 48 points when I was killed
by a NEWT of all things!
